{title: Purano Sei Diner Kotha}
{artist: Rabindra Sangeet}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C] Purano sei [Am] diner kotha,        [C] bhulbi ki re [F] hai O sei,
[C] chokher dekha [Am] praner kotha,        [G] se ki [F] bhola [C] jai.
[C] Aay ar ekti bar [Am] aayre shokha,        [C] praner majhe [F] aay
Mora, [C] shukher dhuker [Am] kotha kobo,        [G] pran [F] jurabe [C] tai.
[C] Mora bhhorer bela [Am] phul tulechi,        [C] dulechi dolai.
[F] Bajiye basi [C] gaan geyechi,        [G] boku [F] ler [C] tolay.
[C] Hai majhe holo [Am] charachai,        [F] gelem ke kothai.
[C] Abar dekha jodi [Am] holo shokha,        [G] praner [F] majhe [C] aay.
[C] Purano sei [Am] diner kotha,        [C] bhulbi ki re [F] hai O sei,
[C] chokher dekha [Am] praner kotha,        [G] se ki [F] bhola [C] jai.
